42. _igi_ sig-an-nu-ni-tum
#tr.ts: maḫar ipqu-annunitum
#tr.en: before Ipqu-annunitum;

43. _igi_ i-bi-{d}nin-szubur _dumu_ nu-ur2-i3-li2-szu
