12. {disz}{d}suen-dingir a-na _e2_ i-ku-un-pi4-{d}suen# a-hi-sza
#tr.ts: sîn-ilī ana bīt ikūn-pî-sîn ahīša
#tr.en: Sîn-ilī into the house of Ikūn-pî-sîn his brother

13. a-na ma-s,a-ar-tim i-zi-ba t,up-[pa-tum szi-na]
#tr.ts: ana ma(ṣ)ṣartim īziba(m) ṭuppātum šina
