15. {disz}sin-dingir ma-har {d}suen-isz-me-[a-ni]
#tr.ts: sîn-ilī maḫar sîn-ismea(n)ni
#tr.en: Sîn-ilī before Sîn-išmeanni

16. u3 _kar zimbir{ki}_ isz-ku-ma# [ki-ma t,up-pa-tum szi-na hal-qa2-a]
#tr.ts: u kār sippir išku(m)ma kīma ṭuppātum šina ḫalqā
